# Regenerable or scratch, deliberately not committed. Everything that constitutes EVIDENCE --
# the emitted engines, the per-cell run records, the per-engine scores, the analysis, the
# reachability probe, the pre-registration and the server witnesses -- IS committed.
#
# windows.pkl (71 MB) is the pickled induction windows plus the fresh held-out sets. It is
# DETERMINISTICALLY REGENERABLE: `python prep.py` rebuilds it from the offline sim at the fixed
# seed recorded in out/prep_meta.json (fresh_seed 20260802, fresh_n 220). out/prep_meta.json --
# which IS committed -- carries every split size, every leak-check count and the sha256 of each
# game's induce prompt, so the split this run actually used is auditable without the pickle.
windows.pkl

# Per-cell scratch engine stores. Redundant: every emitted engine is committed under out/engines/.
e3_store/
__pycache__/

# Library chatter from the offline sim (788 KB of "Found latest version of <game>" lines).
# The prep RESULTS are in out/prep_meta.json.
out/prep.log
